{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"4c20ff54-3dfe-4433-a1e3-274492cdb2fc","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Aoki Hagane no Arpeggio"},"altTitles":[{"en":"Arpeggio of Blue Steel"},{"ru":"\u0410\u0440\u043f\u0435\u0434\u0436\u0438\u043e \u0412\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0451\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0421\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0438"},{"th":"\u0e2a\u0e07\u0e04\u0e23\u0e32\u0e21\u0e40\u0e23\u0e37\u0e2d\u0e23\u0e1a\u0e2a\u0e22\u0e1a\u0e42\u0e25\u0e01"},{"zh":"\u82cd\u84dd\u94a2\u94c1\u7684\u7436\u97f3"},{"ja":"\u84bc\u304d\u92fc\u306e\u30a2\u30eb\u30da\u30b8\u30aa"},{"zh-hk":"\u84bc\u85cd\u92fc\u9435\u7684\u7436\u97f3"},{"ko":"\ud478\ub978\uac15\ucca0\uc758 \uc544\ub974\ud398\uc9c0\uc624"},{"ka":"\u10da\u10e3\u10e0\u10ef\u10d8 \u10e4\u10dd\u10da\u10d0\u10d3\u10d8\u10e1 \u10d0\u10e0\u10de\u10d4\u10ef\u10d8\u10dd"}],"description":{"en":"In the early 21st century, the majority of Earth\u2019s landmass is submerged due to rising sea levels. Enter the Fleet of Fog, a host of sentient alien battleships of unknown origin who easily decimate earth\u2019s naval forces. Humanity is now on the verge of extinction.\n\nIn the year 2056, the stalwart Captain Chihaya Gunzou and his intrepid crew on the Blue Steel fleet may be humanity\u2019s last chance to fight off the alien invaders. The Blue Steel fleet happens to contain a secret weapon that could turn the tide of war: a mysterious I-401 submarine that can transform into a girl.","id":"---\nOfficial Release:\n- Indonesian release by Elex Media"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"55861","ap":"arpeggio-of-blue-steel","bl":"173282","bw":"series\/4688\/list","kt":"19201","mu":"f17ryh0","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B074C5PGC8","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-735636","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/157527","mal":"25861","raw":"https:\/\/comic-y-ours.com\/episode\/2551460909788151968","engtl":"https:\/\/sevenseasentertainment.com\/series\/arpeggio-of-blue-steel"},"officialLink